@startuml statechart-equipment
' Equipment item (FR-07, FR-09, FR-23, FR-26, FR-29, FR-32, FR-33)
[*] --> Operational : addEquipment

state Operational {
  [*] --> Idle
  Idle --> CheckedOut : checkOut
  CheckedOut --> Idle : returnItem [condition Good/Fair]
  Idle --> UnderMaintenance : openMaintenance [admin confirms]
  UnderMaintenance --> Idle : closeMaintenance
}
Operational --> NonOperational : returnItem [condition = Damaged]
Operational --> NonOperational : updateEquipment [status = Non-operational, not checked out]
NonOperational --> Operational : returnToService(Good|Fair) [no open maintenance]
NonOperational --> NonOperational : open/closeMaintenance

note right of NonOperational : cannot be reserved\nor checked out
note bottom of Operational : UnderMaintenance: cannot be reserved\nor checked out (FR-32); existing\nreservations are kept (FR-34)
@enduml
